  "pseudocode": "rank_gap = rank(lpw) - rank(lpl)\nadv_diff = advantage_w - advantage_l\nscaled_input = tanh(alpha * (rank_gap * adv_diff))\nloss = -scaled_input\nreturn median(loss * weight)",
